WEBVTT

00:13.270 --> 00:15.439
<i>‎Akane, I've returned.</i>

00:16.106 --> 00:18.316
‎Is what I want to say...

00:19.943 --> 00:22.654
‎but I must immediately depart.

00:24.031 --> 00:26.616
‎Please don't ask. I cannot say why.

00:27.200 --> 00:30.287
‎However, I can tell you this one thing.

00:31.788 --> 00:35.417
‎I'll return as a complete man
‎by the next time you see me.

00:36.084 --> 00:37.294
‎So, please.

00:37.377 --> 00:41.339
‎Go... go... go...

00:44.134 --> 00:46.261
‎I can't say it!
‎It's too embarrassing to say,

00:46.344 --> 00:48.930
‎"Please go out with me!"

00:49.014 --> 00:52.768
‎You! Stop, you perverted geezer!

00:52.851 --> 00:54.978
‎My eyes had quite a feast, a real feast!

00:55.604 --> 00:56.980
‎Someone, catch him!

01:04.071 --> 01:07.324
‎Damn it. He's so nimble for an old man.

01:07.407 --> 01:09.910
‎He comes to the school
‎every day without fail.

01:09.993 --> 01:12.913
‎We can't just keep chasing him
‎after he's harassed us.

01:12.996 --> 01:14.748
‎Do you have a plan, Akane?

01:14.831 --> 01:15.832
‎That's right.

01:16.500 --> 01:17.626
‎What if we do this?

01:17.709 --> 01:20.545
‎Don't we have gym class tomorrow?

01:20.629 --> 01:21.671
‎So we'll--

01:23.215 --> 01:26.843
‎Ryoga. What are you doing down there?

01:26.927 --> 01:27.928
‎Hey.

01:29.971 --> 01:33.934
‎RANMA1/2

02:59.060 --> 03:01.938
‎So you're going on another trip, Ryoga?

03:02.022 --> 03:04.566
‎QUEST FOR THE HIDDEN SPRING

03:04.649 --> 03:06.568
‎Yeah. I don't know
‎when I'll see you again.

03:07.068 --> 03:10.280
‎Why don't you go see Ranma?
‎Hasn't it been a while?

03:10.363 --> 03:12.073
‎I don't want to see his face.

03:12.157 --> 03:13.408
‎I see.

03:15.577 --> 03:19.164
‎But you guys are
‎actually pretty close, right?

03:19.748 --> 03:22.834
‎As the saying goes, the more you fight...

03:24.210 --> 03:25.712
‎More importantly, Akane--

03:34.304 --> 03:36.848
‎-So, that is...
‎-Yeah?

03:37.432 --> 03:39.809
‎When I return, please...

03:40.602 --> 03:41.811
‎What?

03:41.895 --> 03:44.814
‎Go... go... go...

03:44.898 --> 03:46.816
‎Go ahead and take this.

03:48.318 --> 03:50.028
‎Thanks for always getting me souvenirs.

03:50.111 --> 03:52.280
‎You really are such a nice guy.

03:54.866 --> 03:57.869
‎Okay, take care. Bye.

04:00.413 --> 04:02.707
‎Damn it!

04:02.791 --> 04:04.000
‎Ryoga.

04:05.001 --> 04:06.211
‎-Akane?
‎-I'll give you

04:06.294 --> 04:07.963
‎a goodbye kiss.

04:10.298 --> 04:12.092
‎But, Akane,

04:12.634 --> 04:16.346
‎we haven't even held hands yet--

04:16.429 --> 04:19.391
‎I haven't prepared myself for this...

04:19.474 --> 04:20.976
‎Then forget it.

04:25.188 --> 04:26.940
‎What a violent guy.

04:27.023 --> 04:29.317
‎And it's been so long
‎since we've seen each other.

04:29.401 --> 04:33.071
‎Shut up. How dare you play jokes
‎on a young man's heart.

04:33.655 --> 04:35.782
‎What are you so mad about, P-chan?

04:39.995 --> 04:42.038
‎Too bad, Ranma.

04:42.122 --> 04:45.083
‎Soon, you will be saying
‎farewell to P-chan.

04:47.043 --> 04:49.629
‎And this is the reason why.

04:50.255 --> 04:51.756
‎What kind of map is this?

04:52.465 --> 04:53.842
‎A treasure map?

04:54.342 --> 04:56.136
‎You idiot. Give it back!

04:57.053 --> 04:58.555
‎You, you--

05:03.810 --> 05:04.936
‎Oh, no.

05:06.479 --> 05:10.066
‎The Japanese Spring of the Drowned Man!

05:16.990 --> 05:18.867
‎It's the Japanese Spring
‎of the Drowned Man?

05:22.287 --> 05:23.788
<i>‎Long, long ago,</i>

05:23.872 --> 05:29.169
<i>‎in the province of Musashi, foxes were
‎driving people mad with their mischief.</i>

05:29.753 --> 05:33.465
<i>‎One day, a high monk visiting from China</i>

05:33.548 --> 05:38.011
<i>‎tapped his staff into the ground
‎and up gushed a spring.</i>

05:39.262 --> 05:42.098
<i>‎All the foxes who bathed in this spring</i>

05:42.182 --> 05:46.853
<i>‎suddenly turned into human men.</i>

05:48.063 --> 05:52.817
<i>‎And thanks to that,
‎not a single mischievous fox remained.</i>

05:52.901 --> 05:56.112
<i>‎However, the people gained
‎an even bigger a headache.</i>

05:57.947 --> 06:02.160
‎That's definitely a Spring of Drowned Man.

06:03.369 --> 06:06.331
<i>‎If I can soak in that spring,
‎I'll get rid of this dumb curse.</i>

06:06.414 --> 06:07.457
‎SPRING OF DROWNED MAN

06:08.041 --> 06:09.876
<i>‎And stay as a man forever.</i>

06:12.629 --> 06:14.047
‎So that's why.

06:14.881 --> 06:16.257
‎I'll be heading there.

06:17.884 --> 06:20.178
‎Wait, hold on, Ryoga.

06:20.929 --> 06:23.223
‎Cooperate? Stop joking around.

06:23.306 --> 06:25.934
‎I said I'll take you there.

06:26.017 --> 06:28.103
‎I don't need your help.

06:28.186 --> 06:30.313
‎I have a map.

06:30.396 --> 06:33.066
‎To a lost fool like you,
‎that's casting pearls before swine.

06:34.317 --> 06:37.987
‎Just thinking that I won't be called
‎a pig much longer

06:38.071 --> 06:39.572
‎is making me sad.

06:43.409 --> 06:46.621
‎Hey. That's a dead end.

06:48.373 --> 06:51.292
‎I'll get there eventually
‎if I keep walking.

06:51.376 --> 06:54.504
‎The Japanese Spring of the Drowned Man
‎is waiting for me.

06:55.839 --> 06:58.133
‎Come on. Let me see it.

06:59.342 --> 07:01.594
‎Anyway, I'll be the only one getting
‎rid of this curse--

07:01.678 --> 07:02.971
‎It's this way.

07:03.471 --> 07:06.099
‎That idiot was totally
‎going the wrong way.

07:06.766 --> 07:08.852
‎You bastard! Give it back!

07:10.353 --> 07:12.647
‎Stand. Bow.

07:12.730 --> 07:14.983
‎Finally, our next class is gym.

07:15.066 --> 07:17.902
‎That perverted geezer is going
‎to come and harass us again.

07:17.986 --> 07:19.028
‎Ew.

07:20.572 --> 07:23.658
‎Don't worry. He won't be able to.

07:23.741 --> 07:26.244
‎Akane, did you do something?

07:26.327 --> 07:27.620
‎Kind of.

07:33.376 --> 07:36.463
‎Hey, Ranma. Is this really the place?

07:36.546 --> 07:38.506
‎Isn't this the high school's back garden?

07:38.590 --> 07:39.966
‎I'm sure this is it.

07:40.592 --> 07:44.679
‎According to the map,
‎this fox statue is an important hint...

07:44.762 --> 07:47.348
‎Thanks for showing me the way.

07:49.058 --> 07:52.353
‎Go 100 steps
‎in the direction this fox is pointing.

07:52.437 --> 07:55.148
‎That's where the Spring of Drowned Man is!

07:57.025 --> 07:58.610
‎You asshat. Wait for me.

07:59.569 --> 08:00.904
‎Don't follow me.

08:01.571 --> 08:03.031
‎You coward.

08:03.114 --> 08:05.283
‎Did you want to get
‎a head start that badly?

08:05.867 --> 08:08.036
‎Shut up! You just tagged along.

08:08.703 --> 08:10.538
‎I guided you here!

08:10.622 --> 08:14.501
‎Eighty-four, 85, 86.
‎Is it under that building?

08:14.584 --> 08:17.170
‎Ninety-two, 93, 94.

08:39.526 --> 08:41.736
‎What? That old man isn't here.

08:41.819 --> 08:42.820
‎He got away!

08:43.446 --> 08:44.739
‎Which means...

08:45.490 --> 08:47.033
‎He'll be back for sure.

08:47.116 --> 08:49.118
‎Then, we just need to fight him
‎to the bitter end.

08:49.202 --> 08:50.787
‎Akane, I'll help out.

08:50.870 --> 08:53.498
‎-Me too.
‎-Ninety-eight, 99, 100.

08:53.581 --> 08:56.751
‎It's under the girl's locker room.

08:56.834 --> 08:58.711
‎That's where the Spring of Drowned Man is?

08:59.212 --> 09:00.880
‎Yeah, no doubt.

09:00.964 --> 09:03.508
<i>‎Shit. No matter who gets in my way...</i>

09:04.717 --> 09:07.220
‎There's no way I'll turn back now.

09:07.303 --> 09:08.805
‎We need to work together.

09:11.266 --> 09:13.059
‎Everyone, you're all ready, right?

09:13.142 --> 09:16.271
‎We'll defend
‎and protect the girls' locker room.

09:16.354 --> 09:17.564
‎-Yeah!
‎-Yeah!

09:18.147 --> 09:20.733
‎-One, two. One, two.
‎-<i>‎One, two. One, two.</i>

09:20.817 --> 09:25.280
‎-One, two.
‎-Master. You're not visiting the school?

09:25.363 --> 09:27.365
‎-Yeah, I'll go later.
‎-<i>‎One, two.</i>

09:29.075 --> 09:30.451
‎Preparations are all set.

09:30.535 --> 09:32.996
‎Now I have no choice but to cross-dress.

09:33.079 --> 09:37.625
‎Ranma, don't tell you're planning
‎to go in from the front door?

09:37.709 --> 09:38.960
‎Of course.

09:39.043 --> 09:42.505
‎Unforgivable! Akane is changing in there.

09:42.589 --> 09:46.676
‎You know, don't just suddenly forget
‎why we're here.

09:46.759 --> 09:50.138
‎The Spring of Drowned Man is
‎under the girls' locker room.

09:53.141 --> 09:56.019
‎Hey, do you think
‎that grandpa will really come?

09:56.102 --> 09:57.395
‎He'll come.

09:58.021 --> 10:01.482
‎Today's the day we're going to
‎completely crush him.

10:02.150 --> 10:04.193
‎Otherwise, we won't be
‎able to change in peace.

10:04.277 --> 10:07.947
‎-Oh, no. I left something behind.
‎-Yeah.

10:10.742 --> 10:14.746
‎You silly girl. Didn't we promise
‎to say the password before coming in?

10:15.580 --> 10:18.583
‎I'm sorry. I totally forgot.

10:18.666 --> 10:22.045
‎Now, the Spring of Drowned Man.
‎Where's the Spring of Drowned Man?

10:22.128 --> 10:24.589
‎Ranma. What are you dong?

10:25.506 --> 10:28.217
‎It's in this direction. The distance is...

10:29.469 --> 10:32.180
‎-It's probably around here...
‎-What are you doing?

10:33.389 --> 10:36.059
‎-You shameless bastard!
‎-No! No! No!

10:36.142 --> 10:39.020
‎-Akane! Take it easy.
‎-Easy now, easy.

10:39.103 --> 10:40.229
‎Are you okay?

10:40.313 --> 10:42.523
‎You're so mean, Akane.

10:42.607 --> 10:44.609
‎You!

10:44.692 --> 10:46.819
<i>‎No one's figured out it's me.</i>

10:47.487 --> 10:49.238
<i>‎Putting on a disguise was a good idea.</i>

10:49.322 --> 10:50.990
‎Get out of here.

10:51.074 --> 10:53.993
‎What's wrong with a girl going into
‎the girls' locker--

10:55.328 --> 10:57.955
‎If you don't want to transform
‎right here right now...

10:59.791 --> 11:01.709
‎then get out!

11:01.793 --> 11:03.670
‎You savage woman!

11:03.753 --> 11:05.922
‎So what? You peeping Tom!

11:09.926 --> 11:13.763
‎I'm not blockheaded enough to fall
‎for that and turn back into a man.

11:16.099 --> 11:19.102
‎That's Ranma from the class next to ours.

11:19.644 --> 11:22.271
‎-Oh, my, he's wearing bloomers.
‎-What? Let me see.

11:24.732 --> 11:26.526
‎Damn it!

11:28.945 --> 11:30.279
‎You reap what you sow.

11:30.363 --> 11:34.784
‎What are you sitting all relaxed for?

11:37.328 --> 11:39.664
‎Enough. I'm going to do whatever it takes

11:39.747 --> 11:41.666
‎to permanently stay as a man.

11:42.417 --> 11:43.751
‎Listen, Ryoga.

11:44.627 --> 11:47.004
‎Steal their clothes
‎and run as far as you can.

11:47.672 --> 11:50.091
‎While Akane and the girls are chasing you,

11:50.174 --> 11:52.510
‎I'll dig up the Spring of Drowned Man.

11:52.593 --> 11:53.636
‎Got it?

11:54.637 --> 11:56.347
‎Quit whining and just do it.

11:59.600 --> 12:01.060
‎Isn't that P-chan?

12:01.144 --> 12:03.229
‎-So cute!
‎-P-chan?

12:07.275 --> 12:09.652
‎Where were you, P-chan?

12:20.288 --> 12:22.915
‎-Hey, it's bleeding from its nose.
‎-P-chan?

12:33.718 --> 12:35.845
‎You bastard. Wake up!

12:40.224 --> 12:42.059
‎Sorry for the intrusion.

12:48.274 --> 12:50.651
‎I'm so happy to be alive.

12:51.277 --> 12:54.113
‎Even being a pig has its own rewards.

12:54.197 --> 12:56.824
‎What dumb crap are you spouting?

12:56.908 --> 13:00.119
‎Which is more important? Immediate ecstasy
‎or the Spring of Drowned Man?

13:00.703 --> 13:02.622
‎Immediate ecstasy.

13:02.705 --> 13:05.583
<i>‎That Ranma is always so quick to escape.</i>

13:07.043 --> 13:09.295
‎Ryoga, didn't you leave?

13:10.588 --> 13:14.091
‎Akane. Thanks for earlier.

13:16.177 --> 13:18.846
‎What? Ranma was peeking?

13:18.930 --> 13:22.558
‎Yeah! I never expected him to do that.

13:22.642 --> 13:24.227
‎Leave it to me.

13:24.769 --> 13:27.355
‎As a fellow man, I cannot overlook this.

13:27.438 --> 13:31.400
‎Thank you.
‎I feel so reassured with you here.

13:31.484 --> 13:35.112
‎Anytime, as long as I can be
‎of help to you, Akane.

13:35.196 --> 13:36.364
‎Thank you.

13:37.281 --> 13:39.158
<i>‎As if I'd give up.</i>

13:39.659 --> 13:40.660
<i>‎I did it.</i>

13:41.661 --> 13:43.287
‎There's nobody here.

13:49.293 --> 13:51.045
‎What the heck is this?

13:53.714 --> 13:56.467
‎Gotcha, you underwear thief.

13:57.009 --> 13:59.220
‎Ryoga, you asshat.

13:59.303 --> 14:01.597
‎What about the Spring of Drowned Man?

14:01.681 --> 14:03.307
‎This is for Akane!

14:03.391 --> 14:06.310
‎I'm gonna take you down,
‎you enemy of all women!

14:06.394 --> 14:08.187
‎You traitor!

14:13.651 --> 14:16.237
‎-He won't be able to move for a while.
‎-Old geezer.

14:16.320 --> 14:19.657
‎It's a mountain,
‎a whole treasure mountain!

14:19.740 --> 14:21.701
‎Come on, before it's too late.

14:21.784 --> 14:23.244
‎Wait, old geezer.

14:23.327 --> 14:25.079
‎Was this your plan all along?

14:27.373 --> 14:30.793
‎So you were in cahoots
‎with Grandpa, Ranma.

14:39.385 --> 14:41.095
‎Listen here, Ranma.

14:41.178 --> 14:43.639
‎Let's work together
‎to get those treasures.

14:43.723 --> 14:46.183
‎Don't lump me in with you!

14:49.270 --> 14:52.523
‎Ranma. Come at us from anywhere you want.

14:53.983 --> 14:55.985
‎You better be prepared, Akane.

14:56.068 --> 14:58.487
‎I will do everything I can

14:58.571 --> 15:01.407
‎to get into the girls' locker room!

15:01.490 --> 15:05.161
‎Bravo, Ranma. You'll go that far
‎just for underwear--

15:05.244 --> 15:07.121
‎It's for the Spring of Drowned Man.

15:07.204 --> 15:09.081
‎Anyway.

15:09.165 --> 15:11.500
‎Squabbles with women require...

15:12.043 --> 15:13.836
‎Great. You're disgusting.

15:13.920 --> 15:14.962
‎Ribbit.

15:16.297 --> 15:17.882
‎Nothing beats this method!

15:20.426 --> 15:23.596
‎Stay calm, girls. They're all toys.

15:23.679 --> 15:27.224
‎No! It's a snake! And frogs!

15:27.308 --> 15:30.019
‎They're real, not toys!

15:30.102 --> 15:31.395
‎Ranma!

15:33.314 --> 15:34.357
‎Ribbit.

15:36.442 --> 15:37.902
‎Ribbit, ribbit!

15:40.404 --> 15:41.572
‎Ranma.

15:48.454 --> 15:49.664
‎Thief!

15:58.047 --> 16:00.800
<i>‎Shit. Did he see through my disguise?</i>

16:00.883 --> 16:03.427
<i>‎I thought it was perfect.</i>

16:03.511 --> 16:04.929
‎I'm so sorry!

16:05.012 --> 16:06.806
‎I thought you were Ranma.

16:07.723 --> 16:09.934
‎You're so horrible.

16:10.017 --> 16:12.269
‎I didn't do anything.

16:13.229 --> 16:14.480
‎I'm sorry!

16:14.563 --> 16:16.107
‎Truly sorry!

16:17.608 --> 16:18.609
‎But...

16:23.114 --> 16:24.240
‎I like you.

16:24.323 --> 16:26.075
‎What? Huh? Wait.

16:26.158 --> 16:28.452
‎We just met, how can...

16:28.536 --> 16:31.372
‎Do you hate girls with glasses?

16:31.455 --> 16:33.582
‎No... but...

16:33.666 --> 16:35.584
‎I have someone I love...

16:35.668 --> 16:37.128
‎I don't mind.

16:37.211 --> 16:38.421
‎But...

16:38.504 --> 16:39.672
‎Really?

16:40.965 --> 16:42.299
‎It's lights out for you!

16:42.383 --> 16:44.802
‎What are you doing?

16:44.885 --> 16:48.139
‎Akane. You've got it wrong.

16:48.222 --> 16:49.765
‎I didn't do anything---

16:49.849 --> 16:52.685
‎Hey, Akane! Why do you have
‎to keep getting in my way?

16:52.768 --> 16:57.231
‎Ranma. You'd do something this shameful
‎just to get your hands on some underwear?

16:57.314 --> 17:00.609
‎You idiot. I don't care
‎about the underwear.

17:00.693 --> 17:01.944
‎You want them, right?

17:02.737 --> 17:04.530
‎I'll give them all to you.

17:05.573 --> 17:09.201
‎They're all ones we got
‎to use in a trap anyway.

17:09.285 --> 17:10.661
‎Listen to me...

17:10.745 --> 17:13.748
‎So, please.

17:14.457 --> 17:16.459
‎Stop breaking any more laws.

17:17.209 --> 17:20.379
‎I truly believed
‎you wouldn't do something like this.

17:20.963 --> 17:21.964
‎Goodbye!

17:22.048 --> 17:26.385
‎Wait! I came here to dig up
‎the Spring of Drowned Man.

17:27.678 --> 17:29.055
‎Spring of Drowned Man?

17:30.097 --> 17:33.517
‎It's under the girls' locker room?

17:34.268 --> 17:36.353
‎Was that why, Ranma?

17:36.437 --> 17:38.439
‎Do these look like the eyes of a liar?

17:38.522 --> 17:41.859
‎At least make your lies believable.

17:42.568 --> 17:46.072
‎That was quite the disguise
‎earlier, Ranma.

17:47.448 --> 17:48.532
‎That's right.

17:48.616 --> 17:52.036
‎I've never dated
‎a woman before in my life.

17:53.829 --> 17:56.749
‎Let alone, received a confession.

17:56.832 --> 18:00.544
‎Not even once in my entire life...

18:00.628 --> 18:02.213
‎Did you hear that?

18:02.296 --> 18:03.547
‎Poor guy.

18:05.299 --> 18:06.509
‎What about it?

18:07.635 --> 18:10.471
‎Be honest and tell me, Ranma.

18:10.554 --> 18:14.100
‎Why did you do such an outrageous thing?

18:14.183 --> 18:17.228
‎Naturally, it's for
‎the Spring of Drowned Man--

18:17.311 --> 18:19.146
‎Are you saying...

18:21.482 --> 18:23.609
‎that's why you trampled on

18:23.692 --> 18:27.822
‎a man's innocence over and over again?

18:27.905 --> 18:29.323
‎Shut up.

18:29.406 --> 18:32.159
‎You're the one who showed me

18:32.243 --> 18:34.495
‎the map to the Spring of Drowned Man!

18:38.499 --> 18:41.085
‎Ryoga, is that true?

18:41.585 --> 18:44.755
‎Why would you have a map
‎to the Spring of Drowned Man?

18:48.509 --> 18:50.928
‎Ryoga, don't tell me...

19:09.071 --> 19:10.823
<i>‎My secret's out.</i>

19:11.490 --> 19:13.826
‎You were trying to remove Ranma's curse.

19:14.660 --> 19:16.412
‎You're such a nice guy.

19:17.329 --> 19:20.332
‎Lucky Akane isn't very sharp, huh, P-chan?

19:26.255 --> 19:27.298
‎Who...

19:28.007 --> 19:30.634
‎are you calling P-chan?

19:32.678 --> 19:34.388
‎The Breaking...

19:34.471 --> 19:36.932
‎You're aiming at the wrong target.

19:37.016 --> 19:39.894
‎...Point!

19:55.701 --> 19:58.120
‎This sensation is...

20:03.584 --> 20:05.169
‎We did it.

20:16.764 --> 20:18.140
<i>‎The Spring of Drowned Man.</i>

20:19.058 --> 20:20.851
<i>‎It really was here.</i>

20:22.519 --> 20:23.646
‎Hey.

20:24.647 --> 20:28.692
‎That Spring of Drowned Man map was
‎the real thing, right?

20:30.277 --> 20:32.905
‎Then, why can't I go back to being a man?

20:32.988 --> 20:35.157
‎Say something, you pig!

20:43.082 --> 20:45.459
<i>‎The Japanese Spring of Drowned Man</i>

20:45.542 --> 20:48.879
<i>‎you have patronized
‎for many years has closed.</i>

20:48.963 --> 20:51.423
<i>‎Please visit the original
‎Spring of Drowned Man</i>

20:51.507 --> 20:54.134
<i>‎in Jusenkyo, China for your needs.</i>

20:55.344 --> 20:58.305
‎So it was just a normal bathhouse?

20:58.889 --> 21:02.685
‎Hey! Who was it? Who broke the water pipe?

21:02.768 --> 21:04.270
‎Ranma.

21:08.607 --> 21:10.776
‎Where did you get that underwear from?

21:10.859 --> 21:12.194
‎I picked it up.

21:15.489 --> 21:18.993
‎What's wrong, P-chan? You're so listless.

21:19.076 --> 21:23.122
‎You'll definitely be much happier
‎staying like this, after all.

22:57.049 --> 23:02.054
‎Subtitle translation by: Annie Chen
‎Production Supervisor: Ranma1/2 Project
